      <MissionDesc>CURA SMILES, INC. EXISTS TO EXPAND SUSTAINABLE DENTAL SERVICES TO THE UNDER-SERVED, BOTH LOCALLY AND GLOBALLY. THESES EFFORTS ARE ACCOMPLISHED THROUGH A SYSTEM OF TRAINING AND EQUIPPING LOCAL DENTISTS AND STUDENTS TO PROVIDE THE IMPORTANT ORAL HEALTH CARE SERVICES. THE DENTAL PROCEDURES ARE PROVIDED BY LICENSED DENTISTS AND DENTAL PROFESSIONALS WITH THE ASSISTANCE OF THOSE IN TRAINING. THESE ARE 100% VOLUNTEER SERVICES.</MissionDesc>
