      <Desc>CURA SMILES OPERATES A FREE DENTAL CLINIC IN THE UNDER-SERVED COMMUNITY OF CITY HEIGHTS, LOCATED IN SAN DIEGO, CA. THE CLINIC WAS CONSTRUCTED AND EQUIPPED WITH FIVE DENTAL CHAIRS AND PROVIDES BASIC DENTAL CARE, INCLUDING EXAMINATIONS, X-RAYS, EXTRACTIONS, FILLINGS AND CLEANING. THE CURA SMILES DENTAL PROFESSIONALS PERFORMED OVER 415,000 IN FREE PROCEDURES. 1,514 PROCEDURES WERE PERFORMED FOR THE PATIENTS. 247 PATIENTS WERE TREATED AT CURA SMILES CLINIC DURING 2024. 110 DENTURES WERE PROVIDED FOR PATIENTS DURING 2024. THERE WERE 42 VOLUNTEER DENTIST, DENTAL ASSISTANTS, HYGIENISTS, AND STUDENTS THROUGHOUT 2024. THESE VOLUNTEERS COMPLETED OVER 1,232 HOURS OF SERVICE AT THE CURA SMILES CLINIC.</Desc>
